<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's National Commercial Bank Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi's National Commercial Bank Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31,1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p>Net profit		   267.0    vs     222.5</p>
<p>Net operating income     294.3    vs     255.1</p>
<p>Other income		   8.4    vs	14.9</p>
<p>Shareholders' equity   7,921.8    vs   7,494.8</p>
<p>Assets		    87,449.7    vs  77,537.1</p>
<p>Full Name: National Commercial Bank.</p>
<p>Note - The Jeddah-based bank is the biggest private bank in the kingdom.</p>
<p>-- Manama newsroom +973-536187</p>
</text>
